        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey Melrose Satin Stainless Steel T-Bar Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Melrose Cabinet Pull is available in a huge selection of sizes ranging from a small 3 inch center to center to a large cabinet pull over 2 feet. This makes the Laurey Melrose Satin Stainless Steel T-Bar Cabinet Pull Collection ideal for almost any modern kitchen remodel due to its versatility. Every Melrose Stainless Steel T-Bar Pull comes packaged with its own mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Melrose\">Laurey Melrose Collection</a>.\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Laurey Melrose Satin Stainless Steel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 11 Sizes:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>LAU-89011:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89001:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89012:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89002:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89003:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89004:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>LAU-89005:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89006:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89007:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89008:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-89009:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 28-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
